        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8740985261292017,
        "y0": 0.38130064531629837,
        "x1": 0.9227012826615021,
        "y1": 0.39126855120806114
      },
      "text": "As was",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.39269261801894095,
        "x1": 0.9202508493631828,
        "y1": 0.4026605239107037
      },
      "text": "previously reported on SEC Form 8K filed on February 4, 2011, Wiley recorded a bad debt charge of approximately $9 million",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.40408444574496527,
        "x1": 0.9025500385701155,
        "y1": 0.41405235163672804
      },
      "text": "(after-tax $6 million) related to Borders Group Inc. ( \"Borders\"), which represents the difference between the Company's",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.41547641844760774,
        "x1": 0.9070578182444853,
        "y1": 0.4254443243393705
      },
      "text": "outstanding receivable and expectation of potential offsets and recoveries in the future, as well as existing reserves for",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.42686824617363217,
        "x1": 0.8835796965270483,
        "y1": 0.43683615206539494
      },
      "text": "Borders. The Company does not anticipate any additional charge or bad debt expense with respect to this customer.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.4382600738996565,
        "x1": 0.8980986779477416,
        "y1": 0.44822797979141926
      },
      "text": "Excluding the bad debt charge and prior year restructuring and impairment charges of approximately $3 million, adjusted",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.44965204660229896,
        "x1": 0.512797533564207,
        "y1": 0.45961995249406173
      },
      "text": "operating income rose 11%, or 16% excluding foreign exchange.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.520444879612001,
        "y0": 0.44965204660229896,
        "x1": 0.8838839490874475,
        "y1": 0.45961995249406173
      },
      "text": "Top-line results and improved margins due to higher",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.4610438743283233,
        "x1": 0.44428341649159664,
        "y1": 0.47101178022008605
      },
      "text": "revenue from digital products drove the improvement.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.451930813829438,
        "y0": 0.4610438743283233,
        "x1": 0.9192715172006303,
        "y1": 0.47101178022008605
      },
      "text": "Technology Services expense increased approximately 28% to $32",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.47243584703096586,
        "x1": 0.9277188341156776,
        "y1": 0.48240375292272863
      },
      "text": "million reflecting ongoing investments in digital products and infrastructure, such as WileyPLUS, eBooks, backfiles, and Wiley",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.4838276747569902,
        "x1": 0.15813633253594406,
        "y1": 0.49379558064875295
      },
      "text": "Online Library.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.5051875148419813,
        "x1": 0.9192574637276786,
        "y1": 0.5151554207337441
      },
      "text": "Adjusted to exclude this quarter's bad debt charge of $0.10 per share, last year's impairment and restructuring charge and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.5165793425680056,
        "x1": 0.5923948143710609,
        "y1": 0.5265472484597684
      },
      "text": "foreign exchange, earnings per share (EPS) rose 22% in the quarter to $0.84.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.600042160418855,
        "y0": 0.5165793425680056,
        "x1": 0.9038618328190652,
        "y1": 0.5265472484597684
      },
      "text": "Top-line results and lower interest expense",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.5279713152706482,
        "x1": 0.90452880859375,
        "y1": 0.537939221162411
      },
      "text": "were partially offset by higher technology investments. On a reported basis EPS grew 4% in the quarter to $0.74, or 13%",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.5393631429966725,
        "x1": 0.25687720034302786,
        "y1": 0.5493310488884353
      },
      "text": "excluding foreign exchange.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.5607229830816636,
        "x1": 0.9290507340631565,
        "y1": 0.5706908889734263
      },
      "text": "Revenue for the nine months grew 3%, or 5% excluding foreign exchange. On a year-to- date basis, EPS adjusted to exclude",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.5721148108076879,
        "x1": 0.9189330028886554,
        "y1": 0.5820827166994507
      },
      "text": "the $0.10 per share bad debt charge and the $0.17 per share prior year impairment and restructuring charges grew 15% to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.5835067835103305,
        "x1": 0.291134258879333,
        "y1": 0.5934746894020932
      },
      "text": "$2.44 including foreign exchange.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2987816562171744,
        "y0": 0.5835067835103305,
        "x1": 0.7999521976759454,
        "y1": 0.5934746894020932
      },
      "text": "On a reported basis, EPS grew 20%, or 25% excluding foreign exchange.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.6048666235953215,
        "x1": 0.9262962533646271,
        "y1": 0.6148345294870843
      },
      "text": "Free cash flow for nine months increased 19% to $206 million. Wiley has repurchased 222,000 shares at a cost of $10 million",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.6162584513213458,
        "x1": 0.16720437442555147,
        "y1": 0.6262263572131086
      },
      "text": "this fiscal year.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17485174611836923,
        "y0": 0.6162584513213458,
        "x1": 0.7032264260684743,
        "y1": 0.6262263572131086
      },
      "text": "A four million share repurchase program was announced in September 2010.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.710873797761292,
        "y0": 0.6162584513213458,
        "x1": 0.9216936383928571,
        "y1": 0.6262263572131086
      },
      "text": "Net debt (long term debt less",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.6276502790473703,
        "x1": 0.550077242811187,
        "y1": 0.637618184939133
      },
      "text": "cash and cash equivalents) decreased by $243 million from a year ago.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.6490101191323614,
        "x1": 0.28070399180179884,
        "y1": 0.6589780250241242
      },
      "text": "Management Commentary",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.6703699592173524,
        "x1": 0.9007969447544643,
        "y1": 0.6803378651091152
      },
      "text": "\"Wiley's unique combination of businesses, robust strategies, and sharp focus on the execution of our plans continue to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.6817617869433767,
        "x1": 0.9141107126444328,
        "y1": 0.6917296928351395
      },
      "text": "serve us well,\" said William J. Pesce, President and CEO. \"STMS exhibited solid top-line growth this quarter, driven by higher",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.6931537596460193,
        "x1": 0.39995076155462184,
        "y1": 0.7031216655377821
      },
      "text": "institutional sales and new society relationships.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.40759815889246326,
        "y0": 0.6931537596460193,
        "x1": 0.9152271943933824,
        "y1": 0.7031216655377821
      },
      "text": "Calendar year 2011 journal renewals are ahead of last year, both in timing",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.7045455873720436,
        "x1": 0.1813102145154937,
        "y1": 0.7145134932638064
      },
      "text": "and overall value.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18895758620831146,
        "y0": 0.7045455873720436,
        "x1": 0.44025319844734767,
        "y1": 0.7145134932638064
      },
      "text": "The shift to online books continues.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4479005957851891,
        "y0": 0.7045455873720436,
        "x1": 0.8786728802849265,
        "y1": 0.7145134932638064
      },
      "text": "Wiley Online Library received the Best eProduct /Multidiscipline",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.7159375600746862,
        "x1": 0.4916125898601628,
        "y1": 0.725905465966449
      },
      "text": "Platform Award from the Association of American Publishers.\"",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.737297255183059,
        "x1": 0.8577961897649685,
        "y1": 0.7472651610748218
      },
      "text": "Mr. Pesce continued: \"Professional/Trade bounced back from a tough second quarter, led by business and cooking",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.7486892278857016,
        "x1": 0.5641831341911765,
        "y1": 0.7586571337774644
      },
      "text": "books. Sales of eBooks grew and had a positive effect on gross margin.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5718304802389705,
        "y0": 0.7486892278857016,
        "x1": 0.9085953912815126,
        "y1": 0.7586571337774644
      },
      "text": "In December, Wiley stopped shipping to Borders",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.7600810556117259,
        "x1": 0.42211708902310924,
        "y1": 0.7700489615034887
      },
      "text": "and in February we announced the bad debt charge.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4297644863609506,
        "y0": 0.7600810556117259,
        "x1": 0.8054695706407563,
        "y1": 0.7700489615034887
      },
      "text": "Borders was projected to account for less than 5% of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.7714730283143685,
        "x1": 0.7747631938517594,
        "y1": 0.7814409342061313
      },
      "text": "Professional/Trade revenue in fiscal year 2011, down from more than 10% of revenue a few years ago.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7824105398995536,
        "y0": 0.7714730283143685,
        "x1": 0.9303406274619223,
        "y1": 0.7814409342061313
      },
      "text": "Customer purchasing",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.7828648560403928,
        "x1": 0.9330811059775472,
        "y1": 0.7928327619321556
      },
      "text": "patterns continue to shift, as reflected in the sales of eBooks, the success of online retailers, and the performance of some",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.7942568287430354,
        "x1": 0.264937687721573,
        "y1": 0.8042247346347982
      },
      "text": "brick and mortar booksellers.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.27258508505941437,
        "y0": 0.7942568287430354,
        "x1": 0.9031365146156118,
        "y1": 0.8042247346347982
      },
      "text": "Wiley is well-positioned to capitalize on this shift as a result of our publishing strategy and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.8056486564690597,
        "x1": 0.3334255955800289,
        "y1": 0.8156165623608225
      },
      "text": "multi-channel selling around the world.\"",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.8270084965540507,
        "x1": 0.8954769358915441,
        "y1": 0.8369764024458135
      },
      "text": "Said Mr. Pesce: \"Higher Education is performing well off a record-setting prior year with strong growth in the US partially",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.838400324280075,
        "x1": 0.3384895901720063,
        "y1": 0.8483682301718378
      },
      "text": "offset by a revenue decline in Australia.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.34613698750984767,
        "y0": 0.838400324280075,
        "x1": 0.9055364528623949,
        "y1": 0.8483682301718378
      },
      "text": "Higher Education's gross margin continued its upward trend, increasing to 68.5%",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.8497922969827176,
        "x1": 0.9001137613248424,
        "y1": 0.8597602028744804
      },
      "text": "through nine months of the year, up from 67.6% a year ago, reflecting increased sales of high margin products, including",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.861184124708742,
        "x1": 0.36768265411633405,
        "y1": 0.8711520306005047
      },
      "text": "WileyPLUS, eBooks, and custom publishing.\"",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0620049420525046,
        "y0": 0.9034649119524378,
        "x1": 0.11745702919839811,
        "y1": 0.9138717107704869
      },
      "text": "Outlook",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06200499975380777,
        "y0": 0.9252634999870971,
        "x1": 0.918140981978729,
        "y1": 0.9352314058788599
      },
      "text": "Mr. Pesce concluded: \"Based on year-to-date results, market conditions and leading indicators, we reiterate our fiscal year",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
